fp8_e5m2 KV cache for the TRITON_MLA_SPARSE attention backend (GLM-5.3-Flash on Ampere), plus
VLLM_INDEXER_PREFILL_BUFFER_FACTOR. Against wtdcode/vllm-backport, commit
cde54e8ed390aef9e7d0670474365ae033b38a40 (also applies to master 29e66dad4).
